# Auth tokens (reset & invite)

Flows use `auth_tokens` rows keyed by **SHA-256 hash** of the raw token sent by email.

## Rules

```text
✅ Store tokenHash only; raw token appears once in email URL
✅ Invalidate prior active tokens of the same type before creating a new one (reset)
✅ markUsed on success; reject expired or wrong type
✅ Request-password-reset: no user → return 204 without leaking existence
✅ Reset/invite success: revoke refresh sessions where applicable
❌ Persist or log raw tokens
❌ Reveal whether an email exists on forgot-password public endpoints
```

Shared request/response shapes live in `@default/types/auth`. BFF routes proxy to Nest; do not duplicate Zod entity schemas in features.

Env TTL: `PASSWORD_RESET_TTL_MINUTES`, `INVITE_TTL_HOURS` (Zod env validation).
